bleshooting"]}, {"name": "Security", "topics": ["Static Types Are Not Validation", "Unsafe any", "Type Assertions", "Prototype Pollution", "Untrusted JSON", "Environment Variables", "Secret Types", "Branded Security Types", "Authorization Modeling", "Data Exposure", "Supply-Chain Types"]}, {"name": "Architecture", "topics": ["Domain Models", "DTOs", "Entity Types", "Value Objects", "Branded Identifiers", "Layer Boundaries", "Dependency Direction", "Public vs Internal Types", "Type Ownership", "Shared Contract Packages", "Monorepo Architecture", "Multi-Tenant Types", "Type-Safe Feature Boundaries"]}, {"name": "Production Engineering", "topics": ["Production tsconfig", "Development vs Build Config", "CI Type Checking", "noEmit Type Checks", "Build Pipelines", "Declaration Builds", "Source Maps", "Runtime Validation", "Error Monitoring", "Dependency Updates", "TypeScript Version Upgrades", "Library Compatibility", "Rollback Strategy", "Production Checklist"]}, {"name": "Common TypeScript Mistakes", "topics": ["Using any Everywhere", "Overusing Type Assertions", "Confusing Types and Values", "Trusting External Data", "Incorrect Optional Properties", "Incorrect Object.keys Assumptions", "Enums as Default Choices", "Excessive Generics", "Overly Complex Utility Types", "Ignoring Compiler Errors", "Duplicating Runtime and Static Models", "Type-Level Overengineering"]}, {"name": "Projects", "topics": ["Beginner Projects", "Intermediate Projects", "Advanced Projects", "Library Authoring Project", "Production Capstone"]}, {"name": "Exercises", "topics": ["Beginner Exercises", "Intermediate Exercises", "Advanced Exercises", "Senior Exercises", "Production Exercises"]}, {"name": "Interview Preparation", "topics": ["Beginner Questions", "Intermediate Questions", "Advanced Questions", "Senior Questions", "Staff-Level Questions", "Type Challenges", "Debugging Exercises", "Library Design Interviews", "System Design", "Mock Interviews"]}, {"name": "Reference and Audits", "topics": ["